  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4402.08 Gallon",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4402.08 “Gallon” means a liquid measure that is not corrected for temperature and that contains 231 cubic inches or the equivalent of 4 ¼ pounds of propane or 100 cubic feet of natural gas. The term includes “gross gallons”.\n\nSource. #10021, eff 11-9-11 (from Saf-C 4402.04); ss by #13038, eff 4-20-20 (formerly Saf-C 4402.08)",
